direction: right

cli: cfcode CLI { shape: rectangle }

gateway: cfcode-gateway { shape: rectangle }

Codebase_R2: Artifact Bucket { shape: cylinder }
Codebase_D1: SQLite Database { shape: cylinder }
Codebase_Vectorize: Embedding Index { shape: cylinder }

user_worker: cfcode-codebase-<slug> { shape: rectangle }

do_indexing: IndexingShardDO { shape: rectangle }
do_hyde: HydeShardDO { shape: rectangle }

vertex: Google Vertex AI { shape: cloud }
deepseek: DeepSeek API { shape: cloud }

# Stage 1: Build & Artifact upload
cli -> Codebase_R2: 1. Upload .jsonl Artifact
cli -> gateway: 2. POST /ingest-sharded
gateway -> user_worker: 3. Proxy to dispatch namespace

# Stage 2: Code Fan-out (Fast Path)
user_worker -> Codebase_D1: 4. Insert Job
user_worker -> do_indexing: 5. Fan-out to Shards (Promise.allSettled)
do_indexing -> Codebase_R2: 6. Pull Artifact slice (records.slice)
do_indexing <-> vertex: 7. Embed Code Chunks
do_indexing -> Codebase_Vectorize: 8. Upsert Vectors
do_indexing -> Codebase_D1: 9. Insert to chunks table
do_indexing -> user_worker: 10. Shard Completion
user_worker -> Codebase_D1: 11. Update Job Status

# Stage 3: HyDE Enrichment (Async)
cli -> gateway: 12. POST /hyde-enrich
gateway -> user_worker: 13. Proxy
user_worker -> Codebase_D1: 14. Find chunks missing HyDE
user_worker -> do_hyde: 15. Fan-out to Shards
do_hyde <-> deepseek: 16. Generate 12 Questions per chunk
do_hyde <-> vertex: 17. Embed Questions
do_hyde -> Codebase_Vectorize: 18. Upsert Vectors (kind=hyde)
do_hyde -> Codebase_D1: 19. Insert chunks
do_hyde -> user_worker: 20. Shard Completion
